  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds We will not receive any of the proceeds from the\n    resale of the Common Stock by Streeterville, nor will we receive any proceeds upon conversion of the Series A Preferred Stock. We received\n    $8,000,000 at the Second Closing under the Securities Purchase Agreement and may receive up to an additional $32,000,000, subject to the\n    conditions described herein. See \u201c Use of Proceeds \u201d and \u201c The Streeterville Preferred Facility .\u201d Risk Factors Investment in our Common Stock is speculative and involves a high degree\n    of risk. You should carefully consider the information set forth under \u201c Risk Factors \u201d beginning on page 9\n    and elsewhere in this prospectus before deciding to invest in our Common Stock. Trading Symbol Our shares of Common Stock are listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol \u201cGYGY.\u201d (1) The number of shares of Common Stock that will be outst",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors Investment in our Common Stock is speculative and involves a high degree\n    of risk. You should carefully consider the information set forth under \u201c Risk Factors \u201d beginning on page 9\n    and elsewhere in this prospectus before deciding to invest in our Common Stock. Trading Symbol Our shares of Common Stock are listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol \u201cGYGY.\u201d (1) The number of shares of Common Stock that will be outstanding after\n    this offering as shown above is based on 14,392,000 shares of Common Stock issued and outstanding as of September 4, 2026, but excludes\n    the following: \u25cf 1,500,000 shares of Common\n                                    Stock reserved for issuance under our 2026 Equity Incentive Plan (the \u201c2026 Plan\u201d); \u25cf 184,730 shares of Common Stock issuable upon the conversion of the Bridge Note; \u25cf 1,496,000 shares of Common Stock\nissuable upon ",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
